### ===== CONDOMINIUM =====
# @name listCondominium
GET https://api-vizinhanca.onrender.com/api/v1/condominium
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Search by condominium
# @name searchResidentsByCondominium
GET https://api-vizinhanca.onrender.com/api/v1/condominium/resident/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Search activities by condominium
# @name searchActivitiesByCondominium
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/condominium/activity/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Search by id
# @name searchCondominium
GET https://api-vizinhanca.onrender.com/api/v1/condominium/9
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

